T192 - closed-form ownership bound, final rain-field campaign
Branch experiment/cloud-descriptor-k, base 63e3cf0 (T191). Not merged.
Ultra, raw scale 0.2500, cloud target 480x270, framebuffer 1920x1080,
96 steps, 60 samples per cell, three anchor-bracketed blocks per arm per pose.

Two earlier runs died as infrastructure_invalid:world_entry_lost_during_T135_SAMPLE
with zero cells recorded. Cause was a T191 defect, not memory and not T192:
registration scoped by name prefix left T192's cross-campaign controls
(T190_FIELD_SAFE, T172_STACK_PRE) unregistered. Fixed by taking the union with
the active campaign's arm tables; this run is the first with that fix.

=== variant scope, with the cross-campaign fix ===
